  "Column (4) headers list three percentage columns (Tower/Residential/General Common Elements) and column (6)/(5) headers repeat for first-year monthly, first-year annual, and second-year annual real estate taxes; I used Projected First Year Monthly Real Estate Taxes as tax_m/tax_a (annual) since that is the first-listed/primary figure, and Projected Second Year Monthly Real Estate Taxes as tax2_m per field instructions, consistent with carrying-charge column (7) \"Common Charges and Real Estate Taxes\" which appears to use first-year figures.",
  "The \"pct\" column used is \"Percentage Interest in Tower Common Elements\"; pct2 was left blank since instructions only define one additional percentage column and there are two more (Residential and General) not captured — \"Percentage Interest in Residential Common Elements\" and \"Percentage Interest in General Common Elements\" are not transcribed per unit beyond pct.",
